      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 5.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "um, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.7,
      "end_seconds": 11.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "No problem at all come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.59,
      "end_seconds": 19.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "doctor, uh, it's sneezing in spring it's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.14,
      "end_seconds": 28.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.53,
      "end_seconds": 34.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I've had it since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.66,
      "end_seconds": 38.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "is anything making it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.53,
      "end_seconds": 42.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I notice it it more with pollen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.49,
      "end_seconds": 47.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "What about a runny itchy nose, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.07,
      "end_seconds": 50.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "yes I have"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.24,
      "end_seconds": 57.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Have you noticed facial pain, wheeze, fever or loss of smell?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.18,
      "end_seconds": 60.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.19,
      "end_seconds": 62.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.34,
      "end_seconds": 66.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.45,
      "end_seconds": 72.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "so, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.51,
      "end_seconds": 79.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.74,
      "end_seconds": 101.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.67,
      "end_seconds": 107.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.39,
      "end_seconds": 110.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "right, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.78,
      "end_seconds": 114.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.35,
      "end_seconds": 119.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.34,
      "end_seconds": 126.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Yes, diclofenac. I get swelling of my lips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.64,
      "end_seconds": 147.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.19,
      "end_seconds": 150.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "no, I'm not on anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.92,
      "end_seconds": 165.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.02,
      "end_seconds": 177.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "right bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.08,
      "end_seconds": 200.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 15 heart rate 79 pressure 118 over 76 saturation 99 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.53,
      "end_seconds": 207.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.6,
      "end_seconds": 211.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.36,
      "end_seconds": 235.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "the inside of the nose is pale and boggy with clear mucus"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.54,
      "end_seconds": 242.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Right, you can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.89,
      "end_seconds": 266.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards seasonal allergic rhinitis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.04,
      "end_seconds": 270.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.11,
      "end_seconds": 299.89,
      "duration_seconds": 28.78,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's seasonal allergic rhinitis, and we'll watch how it goes. We'll begin with fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, the season. That should help with hay fever. Shower after being outdoors and keep windows shut when pollen is high. Let's plan a check if not better in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.41,
      "end_seconds": 302.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "I can manage that that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.4,
      "end_seconds": 312.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.55,
      "end_seconds": 325.66,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "so, I take the fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day and come back if not better in a month is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.91,
      "end_seconds": 331.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Yes exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.63,
      "end_seconds": 338.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "thank you that's helpful"
    }
  ]
